{"job":"lawn-r4-b-scale","role":"scale","purpose":"量化跨边界修复在不同纹理分辨率下吞掉的草纹","name":"band_detail_change","fields":["old_gradient","new_gradient","floor"],"specification":"Return signed relative directional fine-detail change as (new_gradient-old_gradient)/max(old_gradient,floor); both gradients finite/nonnegative, floor>0. Return zero for invalid nonpositive floor. Positive means amplification. Explain per-side bands and why camera LOD and normalized-width tests remain separate.","handoff":[{"taskId":"lawn-r4-a-scale","actualResponseText":"{
  "name": "detail_mix",
  "expression": "0 if far <= near else (1 if distance <= near else (0 if distance >= far else min(1, max(0, 1 - 3 * ((distance - near) / (far - near)) ** 2 + 2 * ((distance - near) / (far - near)) ** 3))))",
  "implementation": "将 distance、near、far 统一为世界空间米制距离；表达式返回细草权重，过渡单调下降且两端一阶导数为零。近远表示使用同一世界坐标与固定种子生成对应草簇，以该权重渐隐或稳定抖动，勿按距离硬切，以减轻可见 LOD 圆环；保留路面、设施及树干净空排除遮罩。",
  "limits": "假定输入为有限实数；far<=near 时返回零，不处理 NaN 或无穷值。该权重本身不能消除种子、密度或材质不一致产生的接缝。仅依据所给照片采样统计及几何描述作背景，未读取原图或实测标定；未分割统计不能确定草叶尺度或 near/far，不同物理相机的像素不可直接配对。"
